            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The paper presents a combination of two methods of regional anesthesia for axillofemoral bypass surgery. In the patient with coronary arthery disease and a high risk of anesthesia, brachial plexus block and thoracic epidural anesthesia was performed.</AbstractText>
